      "name": "Box<[MaybeUninit<T>]>::assume_init",
      "rationale": "The final unsafe conversion is valid because the source Vec length covers the initialized prefix; the harness carries that initialized sequence through to Box<[T]>.",
      "source_lines": "alloc/src/boxed.rs:1229-1259",
      "status": "minimal_trusted_boundary_for_maybe_uninit_slice_initialization_cast"
    }
